    description: "Concept DOI (all versions). Replace with the version-specific v2.1 DOI once published."
abstract: >
  APIS v2.1 is an additive update to APIS v2.0 (the Agent Passport Issuance
  Standard). It adds confidential-compute attestation (Tier 2.0), algorithmic
  attestation-tier resolution, issuer-written and provider-neutral namespace
  proof (DNS-TXT / HTTPS .well-known), evidence kinds, and model-scope mandates,
  and includes a verified reference proof (Herman) demonstrating
  root -> issuer delegation -> realm issuer -> agent passport -> DNS anchor
  validation from published artifacts.
